						(size 1.27 1.27)
					)
				)
			)
			(property "Package" "UFQFPN-32, 5 x 5 x 0.55 mm, 0.5 mm pitch, with exposed pad 33. Pin names, numbers and electrical types transcribed and programmatically re-verified against the archived ST DS12484 Rev 3 Table 2 (33/33 exact). VDD_D (3), VDD_A (7), VDD_RF (9) and VDD_AM (11) are REGULATOR OUTPUTS typed as outputs, not power inputs - the retired placeholder modelled VDD_D as a 3V3 supply input, which was inverted. External supply inputs are VDD_IO (1), VDD (8), VDD_TX (10) and VDD_DR (14). Locked mapping for integration: VDD_IO to +3V3; VDD and VDD_TX both to NFC_5V_PA_PENDING sharing one supply; I2C_EN (20) to GND to select SPI; BSS (29) is the SPI chip select per Table 2 and maps to NFC_CS_N; SCLK/MOSI/MISO to SPI_B. REQUIRED DECOUPLING, quoted from DS12484 p.40-41 and queued for the integration session: VDD_D 2.2uF||10nF, VDD_A 2.2uF||10nF, VDD_RF 2.2uF||10nF, VDD_AM 2.2uF||1nF (note 1nF, not 10nF), AGDC 1uF||10nF. Beta uses NORMAL internal-regulator mode; the >350mArms bypass configuration tying VDD_RF and VDD_DR to VDD_TX is NOT used. VDD_DR normal-mode external source is still UNRESOLVED - no footprint is assigned yet and NFC antenna/matching remains DO NOT ROUTE."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(hide yes)
				(effects
					(font
						(size 1.27 1.27)
					)
				)
			)
