	(text "SPI BUS B - BETA BRING-UP RISK\n\nTHREE SHARED DEVICES:\nCC1101 + SX1262 + ST25R3916\n\nALL THREE CS LINES HAVE HARDWARE PULL-UPS\n\nST25R3916 WAS VALIDATED STANDALONE ON ALPHA\nNFC AS THIRD BUS-B DEVICE IS FIRST VALIDATED ON BETA\n\nFIRMWARE MUST:\n- DRIVE ALL CS HIGH BEFORE INITIALIZATION\n- USE A BUS MUTEX\n- SET SPI MODE / FREQUENCY PER TRANSACTION\n- VERIFY NO DEVICE HOLDS MISO\n\nDO NOT ROUTE NFC UNTIL PACKAGE, POWER SUPPORT,\nCLOCK, RF MATCHING AND ANTENNA ARE SELECTED"
