			(hide yes)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Package" "20.0 x 14.0 x 3.0 mm castellated module, 22 pads, 1.27 mm pitch with a 5.57 mm gap at the IPEX end, all dimensioned in Ebyte manual chapter 3. VCC 2.5-3.6 V, supplied from +3V3. Pin 16 is MISO multiplexed with GDO1. Pins 6, 7, 8, 10 and 13 are vendor NC. GDO2 (14) is intentionally left unconnected - the manual states it may be left unconnected with interrupt status obtained by SPI polling, and AQROOT allocates no GPIO for it. Antenna: module IPEX/u.FL with Taoglas FXP450.07.0100C; pin 21 ANT stamp hole present but NOT routed. RF DO NOT ROUTE until final RF review. Procurement: Beta units must ship with the IPEX connector populated."
			(at 87.63 57.15 0)
			(hide yes)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
