	(symbol
		(lib_id "AQROOT_Beta:ST25R3916-AQET")
		(at 91.44 143.51 0)
		(unit 1)
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(in_bom yes)
		(on_board yes)
		(dnp no)
		(fields_autoplaced yes)
		(uuid "be3987f0-2ee7-4e2b-996f-affa37e3eed3")
		(property "Reference" "U9"
			(at 91.44 143.51 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Value" "ST25R3916-AQET"
			(at 91.44 143.51 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Note" "FBV2-S2-001: **DNP -> FIT**. `U9` AND ITS ENTIRE SUPPLY-DECOUPLING NETWORK ARRIVED FROM BETA-DM MARKED DNP, WHICH DIRECTLY CONTRADICTS TWO STANDING CTO DECISIONS: D-035, 'NFC is mandatory in the FIRST Full Beta v2 fabrication. No DNP showcase shortcut', and D-055, 'NFC must be FITTED and functional on the first fabrication'. The board would otherwise have been built with a complete, fitted 13.56 MHz matching network, crystal, antenna connector and SPI wiring - and no NFC chip. FITTED WITH IT: C19 and C55 on NFC_SUPPLY, C45/C46 on VDD_D, C47/C48 on VDD_A, C49/C50 on VDD_RF, C51/C52 on VDD_AM and C53/C54 on AGDC - twelve parts that are all mandatory supply decoupling in DS12484, not options. Part is ST25R3916-AQET, LCSC C5267441 (D-126). Six pins remain deliberately unconnected - CSO, EXT_LM, AAT_A, AAT_B, CSI and MCU_CLK - because capacitive sensing, external load modulation, antenna auto-tuning and the MCU clock output are all optional features this product does not use; each carries a recorded ERC exclusion."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Footprint" "AQROOT_Beta:ST25R3916_AQET"
			(at 91.44 143.51 0)
			(hide yes)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Datasheet" "https://www.st.com/en/nfc/st25r3916.html"
			(at 91.44 143.51 0)
			(hide yes)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Description" "ST25R3916 high performance NFC universal device and EMVCo reader, UFQFPN-32"
			(at 91.44 143.51 0)
			(hide yes)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Note2" "SOURCING 2026-08-23 (FBV2-S2-002) (B-71). ST25R3916-AQET is LCSC C5267441 with STOCK 6 against a need of 5 - one spare, and this is a UFQFPN-32 5x5 with an exposed pad, i.e. the single part on this board that genuinely cannot be hand-placed. Buy spares from a broadline distributor and consign. LCSC/JLC library state verified live on 2026-08-23 through the JLCPCB parts API (D-096). Stock is a snapshot, not a guarantee."
			(at 91.44 143.51 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Manufacturer" "STMicroelectronics"
			(at 91.44 143.51 0)
			(hide yes)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "MPN" "ST25R3916-AQET"
			(at 91.44 143.51 0)
			(hide yes)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "LCSC" "C5267441"
			(at 91.44 143.51 0)
			(hide yes)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Package" "UFQFPN32 5x5x0.55, 0.5 mm pitch, 32 lands + exposed pad 33. LOCKED 2026-08-23 (FBV2-S1-004B): ST25R3916-AQET, NOT the B variant. Normal internal RF-regulator mode: VDD_IO on +3V3; VDD and VDD_TX both on NFC_SUPPLY, which is +3V3 on the first build through the R106 FIT link with the R107 DNP link as the no-respin 5 V fallback; I2C_EN grounded to select SPI; VDD_DR sourced from the VDD_RF regulated node - NOT tied to VDD_TX, which would be the regulator-bypass configuration and is not used. Regulator outputs VDD_D, VDD_A, VDD_RF and VDD_AM plus reference AGDC each carry ST-specified local decoupling. Exposed pad grounded per ST. FIRMWARE MUST SET sup3V. AAT_A/AAT_B, CSI/CSO, EXT_LM and MCU_CLK are explicit no-connects. RF front end and 27.12 MHz crystal are captured; every matching value is TUNE until STSW-ST25R004 is run."
			(at 91.44 143.51 0)
			(hide yes)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
