		(property "Note" "LOCKED 2026-08-23 (FBV2-S2-002). Yajingxin TXM27.12M0004322DBBDO00T, LCSC C362365, stock 3421 live on 2026-08-23. Manufacturer data sheet read: SMD3225-4P, 27.120000 MHz fundamental, CL 10 pF, ESR 30 R max, drive level 100 uW max, frequency tolerance +/-10 ppm at 25 C, stability +/-20 ppm over -40..+85 C, aging +/-5 ppm/year, Co 0..5 pF. Total +/-30 ppm is far inside the ISO/IEC 14443 carrier requirement (+/-7 kHz = +/-516 ppm at 13.56 MHz). B-03 FOOTPRINT VERIFIED TIER 1: the data sheet SUGGESTED LAYOUT gives 1.4 x 1.2 mm pads with a 0.8 mm column gap and a 0.5 mm row gap, i.e. centres at (+/-1.10, +/-0.85). Crystal:Crystal_SMD_3225-4Pin_3.2x2.5mm is 1.4 x 1.2 at (+/-1.10, +/-0.85) - EXACT MATCH. Package 3.20 +/-0.1 x 2.50 +/-0.1 x 0.70 +/-0.1; pins 1/3 are the crystal, 2/4 are GND."
			(at 0 0 0)
