	(text "=== FBV2-S1 RADIOS + NFC (FBV2-S1-004) - RF ARCHITECTURE LOCKED ==="
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.0 195.0 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fb041200-a200-4a00-9a00-000000000200")
	)
	(text "433 MHz: INTERNAL Taoglas FXP450.07.0100C flex (410-470 MHz, 47 x 17 x 0.28 mm, 100 mm 1.37 mm coax, IPEX MHF-I) onto the U7 module socket. 915 MHz: EXTERNAL - U8 IPEX -> short pigtail -> top-panel SMA bulkhead. NEITHER band has a board RF trace, a matching network or an RF switch. Module pin 21 (stamp hole) is the alternative feed and stays NC on both modules."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.0 199.0 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fb041201-a201-4a01-9a01-000000000201")
	)
	(text "The U7 IPEX socket must stay SERVICE-ACCESSIBLE with the enclosure open: if internal 433 performance disappoints on the first units, the flex unplugs and an external pigtail goes in its place with NO PCB respin (D-049)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.0 205.0 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fb041202-a202-4a02-9a02-000000000202")
	)
	(text "=== NFC FRONT END - TOPOLOGY IS REAL, VALUES ARE NOT FINAL ==="
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 300.0 300.0 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fb041203-a203-4a03-9a03-000000000203")
	)
	(text "Every part marked TUNE is an INITIAL VALUE. The matching and RX-divider values cannot be finalised until the 45 x 45 mm antenna impedance is measured and the ST antenna matching tool (STSW-ST25R004) is run against it. TP37/TP38 are the measurement points - probe NFC_ANT_A / NFC_ANT_B with a VNA before fitting a final set. All tuning parts are 0603 so they can be reworked by hand."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 300.0 304.0 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fb041204-a204-4a04-9a04-000000000204")
	)
	(text "TX chain per side: RFOx -> L_EMC -> [C_EMC + C_p to GND] -> C_s -> R_q -> antenna. C_EMC and C_p are two separate shunt footprints on the same node ON PURPOSE: it gives two trim positions instead of one. R_q is fitted 0 R and is raised to widen bandwidth / lower Q if the read range needs it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 300.0 312.0 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fb041205-a205-4a05-9a05-000000000205")
	)
	(text "RX chain per side: antenna -> C_rx_series -> [C_rx_shunt to GND] -> R_rx -> RFIx. The divider must keep RFIx inside its input range at full field; it is sized with the same tool run."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 300.0 318.0 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fb041206-a206-4a06-9a06-000000000206")
	)
	(text "NOT FITTED on the first build, and the pins are explicitly NC: AAT_A / AAT_B (automatic antenna tuning needs external varactors, and DS12484 warns against combining AAT with hardware wake-up), CSI / CSO (capacitive sensing), EXT_LM (external load-modulation MOSFET - the internal load modulator is used), MCU_CLK (the ESP32-S3 has its own clocks)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 300.0 324.0 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fb041207-a207-4a07-9a07-000000000207")
	)
	(text "SUPPLY: VDD (pin 8) and VDD_TX (pin 10) now sit on NFC_SUPPLY, not on the Beta-DM boost output - this closes B-41. NFC_SUPPLY is +3V3 on the first build through the R106 FIT link on sheet 01; the R107 DNP link is the no-respin 5 V fallback. VDD_IO (pin 1) stays on +3V3. FIRMWARE MUST SET sup3V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 300.0 332.0 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fb041208-a208-4a08-9a08-000000000208")
	)
	(text "ONE HIGH-POWER TRANSMITTER AT A TIME (MX-1). CC1101 TX, SX1262 +22 dBm TX and the NFC field are mutually exclusive until measurement proves concurrency safe."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 300.0 340.0 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fb041209-a209-4a09-9a09-000000000209")
	)
