		(property "Note2" "SOURCING 2026-08-23 (FBV2-S2-002) (B-71). The bare order code BM02B-ACHSS-GAN-ETF resolves to LCSC C20088622 with STOCK 0; the identical part under JST s lead-free/tin plating suffix, BM02B-ACHSS-GAN-ETF(LF)(SN), is C5118738 with 16260 in stock. The MPN string was corrected to the stocked one. LCSC/JLC library state verified live on 2026-08-23 through the JLCPCB parts API (D-096). Stock is a snapshot, not a guarantee."
